  "backstory": "Garthax comes from a long line of dragonborn soldiers who served in various conflicts. He enlisted at a young age, eager to prove himself and bring honor to his family name. During his service, he developed exceptional tracking skills and proficiency with a bow, making him a valuable scout. However, a disastrous mission where his unit was ambushed and many lives were lost left him disillusioned with military life. He deserted, seeking a more meaningful existence in the wilderness, where he could use his skills to protect the innocent and uphold justice in his own way.",
  "flaws": [
    "Haunted by past failures; easily triggered by mentions of the war.",
    "Acts impulsively, often rushing into situations without thinking."
  ],
  "ideals": [
    "Greater Good: My gifts are meant to alleviate the suffering of others.",
    "Justice: I will bring evildoers to justice, even if it means bending the law."
  ],
  "bonds": [
    "Loyal to a fallen comrade whose memory he seeks to honor.",
    "Protective of the weak and innocent, particularly those affected by war."
  ],
  "traits": [
    "Quiet and observant; prefers listening to speaking.",
    "Skilled tracker and hunter; comfortable in the wilderness.",
    "Always willing to help those in need, despite his gruff exterior."
  ],
